There is provided a method of producing a containerboard having a geometric SCT index of 37.0-42.0 Nm/g when measured according to ISO 9895:2008, comprising the steps of:
- providing a pulp having a Schopper-Riegler (SR) value of 15-19 when measured according to ISO 5267-1:1999, wherein at least 70% by dry weight of the pulp is NSSC pulp;
- forming a web from the pulp;
- pressing the web in a press section comprising a shoe press, wherein the shoe press comprises a shoe press belt having discontinuous grooves and the line load in the shoe press is in the range of 1400-2000 kN/m;
- drying the web from the press section in a drying section to obtain said containerboard.

